      {
         "step": 1,
         "text": "Write the Cartesian coordinates in terms of \\( \\theta \\): \\( x = r\\cos\\theta = \\left(2\\sin(2\\theta)\\right)\\cos\\theta \\) and \\( y = r\\sin\\theta = \\left(2\\sin(2\\theta)\\right)\\sin\\theta \\). At \\( \\theta = \\frac{\\pi}{3} \\), \\( r = \\sqrt{3} \\).",
         "mathjson": [
            "Sqrt",
            3
         ]
      },
      {
         "step": 2,
         "text": "Differentiate each product with respect to \\( \\theta \\): \\( \\frac{dx}{d\\theta} = \\frac{dr}{d\\theta}\\cos\\theta - r\\sin\\theta \\) and \\( \\frac{dy}{d\\theta} = \\frac{dr}{d\\theta}\\sin\\theta + r\\cos\\theta \\), where \\( \\frac{dr}{d\\theta} = 4 \\cos{\\left(2 \\theta \\right)} \\), which is \\( -2 \\) at \\( \\theta = \\frac{\\pi}{3} \\).",
         "mathjson": -2
