      {
         "step": 3,
         "text": "At \\( \\theta = \\frac{\\pi}{3} \\): \\( \\frac{dx}{d\\theta} = - \\frac{5}{2} \\) and \\( \\frac{dy}{d\\theta} = - \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2} \\).",
